Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:11.57,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\frz344.1\pos(1549,262)}活该
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:11.69,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\frz16.09\pos(891,540)}无聊，浪费时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:11.98,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\pos(387,37)\frz356.5}暴力女去死死死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:12.07,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\frz6.382\pos(723,533)}这么丑就别嚣张
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:12.19,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\pos(1629,681)\frz352.9}下次准备打谁??
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:12.99,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\frz334.4\pos(674,922)}让人不快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:12.99,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\pos(847,84)\frz357.9}我来看夜拳的人，而不是你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:12.19,OP_Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(60,0)\frz48.49\pos(1301,811)}快引退快引退快引退
